WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:23.239
Once upon a time there was a young wizard.

2
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.876
His name was Tom.

3
00:00:26.877 --> 00:00:32.198
Tom studied hard at wizard school.

4
00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:39.315
But he was not good at magic.

5
00:00:39.316 --> 00:00:49.943
"Tom, turn me into a tree," said Master Wizard.

6
00:00:49.944 --> 00:00:58.268
Tom waved his wand. Poof!

7
00:00:58.269 --> 00:01:09.261
Master Wizard turned into a bee!

8
00:01:09.262 --> 00:01:16.985
The other wizards laughed.

9
00:01:16.986 --> 00:01:21.996
Master Wizard sighed.

10
00:01:21.997 --> 00:01:25.531
"Tell me again, Tom.

11
00:01:25.532 --> 00:01:29.398
Why do you want to be a wizard?"

12
00:01:29.399 --> 00:01:35.507
"I want to use magic to help people," said Tom.

13
00:01:35.508 --> 00:01:40.973
"That's a fine wish, Tom," said Master.

14
00:01:40.974 --> 00:01:54.299
"But you must practice—a lot!"

15
00:01:54.300 --> 00:02:05.655
One day a trumpet blared.

16
00:02:05.656 --> 00:02:19.871
It was a messenger from the palace!

17
00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:23.938
"Hear this!" cried the messenger.

18
00:02:23.939 --> 00:02:29.588
"The king needs a new royal wizard.

19
00:02:29.589 --> 00:02:36.159
This school may send one student to try out."

20
00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:40.701
"Maybe I can try out," thought Tom.

21
00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:51.507
"I could use magic to help the whole kingdom!"

22
00:02:51.508 --> 00:02:56.966
Later Tom found Master Wizard.

23
00:02:56.967 --> 00:03:01.769
"Master, may I try out?" Tom asked.

24
00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:08.513
The other wizards laughed.

25
00:03:08.514 --> 00:03:13.963
"You can't be the royal wizard," said Walter.

26
00:03:13.964 --> 00:03:17.849
"You're no good at magic!"

27
00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:22.760
"We'll see, Tom," Master said kindly.

28
00:03:22.761 --> 00:03:25.473
"Hooray!" Tom cheered.

29
00:03:25.474 --> 00:03:32.513
He waved his wand by mistake. Poof!

30
00:03:32.514 --> 00:03:37.956
"You fool!" Walter cried.

31
00:03:37.957 --> 00:03:40.467
Tom looked up.

32
00:03:40.468 --> 00:03:44.726
The ceiling had a big hole.

33
00:03:44.727 --> 00:03:55.626
"Oops!" said Tom.
